  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "In twenty twenty-four, two Premier League clubs lost points, not on the pitch, but on their spreadsheets.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "EVERTON & FOREST",
        "sub": "Premier League · 2023-24",
        "pill": "FOOTBALL'S BIGGEST SCANDALS",
        "person": "dyche"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule is Profit and Sustainability. Lose more than a hundred and five million pounds over three years, and you're in trouble.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "PSR",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "£105m",
            "l": "max loss"
          },
          {
            "n": "3",
            "l": "years"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Everton went over. November twenty twenty-three: ten points gone in one go.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "dyche",
        "label": "EVERTON: -10",
        "mood": "shocked"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On appeal, it was cut to six. Then in April, a second breach. Two more.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "timeline",
        "title": "Everton's season",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "Nov",
            "label": "-10 points"
          },
          {
            "year": "Feb",
            "label": "Cut to -6"
          },
          {
            "year": "Apr",
            "label": "-2 more"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Nottingham Forest were hit in March. Four points, and their appeal failed.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "nuno",
        "label": "FOREST: -4",
        "mood": "worried",
        "stamp": "-4"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Total damage: Everton eight points, Forest four.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "Points deducted",
        "left": {
          "person": "dyche",
          "label": "Everton",
          "value": "-8"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "nuno",
          "label": "Forest",
          "value": "-4"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's how the bottom of the table finished.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "Premier League 2023-24",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "15 Everton",
            "value": "40",
            "club": "eve",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "16 Brentford",
            "value": "39",
            "club": "bre"
          },
          {
            "name": "17 Nottingham Forest",
            "value": "32",
            "club": "nfo",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "18 Luton Town",
            "value": "26",
            "club": "lut"
          },
          {
            "name": "19 Burnley",
            "value": "24",
            "club": "bur"
          },
          {
            "name": "20 Sheffield United",
            "value": "16",
            "club": "shu"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Both stayed up. Forest finished six points clear of Luton in eighteenth.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "SURVIVED",
        "color": "yellow"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Without the deductions, Everton would have had forty-eight points, level with Brighton and Bournemouth.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Everton without -8",
        "real": {
          "label": "Everton, 15th",
          "value": "40"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Everton",
          "value": "48"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Forest would have had thirty-six. Still seventeenth.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Forest without -4",
        "real": {
          "label": "Forest, 17th",
          "value": "32"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Forest, 17th",
          "value": "36"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So the table moved, but the three relegated clubs stayed exactly the same.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "What changed",
        "body": "Luton, Burnley and Sheffield United went down either way. The deductions decided how close it got, not who fell."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Two clubs, twelve points, and a warning to everyone else in the league.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "title": "Premier League 2023-24",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "Everton -8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "Forest -4"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more, and play Road to Ballon d'Or at knowitball dot co dot uk.",
